abstract: "Knot shows what repeats in a text, a picture or a recording, and compares each result with chance where it can. Each result becomes a tile, and a room of tiles becomes one girih. It runs in the browser."
keywords:
  - repetition
  - pattern
  - text
  - image
  - sound
  - girih
  - collective
